# Phase 8 Task 2: bundled Gemini key for the packaged MSI. Lives in
# backend/app/keys.py. NEVER commit a populated value — the key is
# extractable from any shipped binary, so leaking it through git
# (where it'd live forever) is much worse than the MSI exposure.
# A committed keys.example.py shows the structure for fresh clones.
backend/app/keys.py


